  "description": "Powerful 48V 250W Brushless Motor\nEquipped with a 250W motor delivering 70Nm of torque, the HITWAY BK15 PLUS easily handles slopes up to 25°. Smooth, quiet, and efficient, this motor ensures strong climbing power and reliable performance for daily commuting and off-road riding.\nLong-Range 48V 15.6Ah Removable Battery\nRide with confidence thanks to a 748.8Wh high-capacity lithium battery. Enjoy an impressive range of 80–150 km per charge, depending on terrain and riding mode. The removable anti-theft design makes charging and security simple and convenient.\nSmart NFC + Bluetooth Display\nUnlock a new level of intelligent riding. The advanced LCD display supports NFC unlocking and Bluetooth connection with the HITWAY APP, allowing you to monitor speed, mileage, and battery status with ease while enjoying smart app-based controls.\nDual Suspension System for Comfort\nFeaturing a lockable front fork and central shock absorber, the BK15 PLUS absorbs bumps and vibrations for a smoother ride. Ideal for urban streets, country paths, or uneven terrain, this suspension system ensures both comfort and stability.\nLarge 29\" Wheels & Practical Design\nWith puncture-resistant 29x2,125\" tyres, lightweight 27kg aluminium alloy frame, and Shimano 7-speed gear system, this e-bike adapts to multiple terrains. Thoughtful details such as front and rear lights, adjustable mudguards, and ergonomic design make every ride safer and more enjoyable.",
